WEBVTT

00:00.864 --> 00:01.002
Not yet!

00:02.143 --> 00:03.266
Stop!

00:03.267 --> 00:03.570
[Wolf's Howl]
Stop!

00:07.072 --> 00:08.160
Damn you…

00:10.240 --> 00:11.696
Stun Howl…

00:13.072 --> 00:14.304
…isn't working?!

00:20.432 --> 00:22.016
Victory is mine.

00:23.422 --> 00:27.056
Noel Stollen. You've impressed me.

00:27.968 --> 00:30.384
You were my best enemy yet.

00:33.406 --> 00:35.504
Why aren't you finishing me off?

00:38.611 --> 00:41.760
The Gambinos told you to kill me, right?

00:42.448 --> 00:45.504
I-I know that! I'm just…

00:48.240 --> 00:50.608
Wh-What are you doing?! Let go…

00:50.688 --> 00:52.768
Don't be so soft!

00:53.088 --> 00:54.672
You can't pity your enemies!

00:55.081 --> 00:58.985
Albert Gambino won't show you mercy
if you let me go!

00:59.552 --> 01:01.040
B-But…

01:01.328 --> 01:06.333
There's nothing more valuable
in this world than your own life!

01:06.848 --> 01:10.720
You can't just throw it away for an enemy!

01:12.368 --> 01:15.072
What's this man talking about?

01:16.233 --> 01:19.641
Is he giving up his life so that I can live?

01:20.784 --> 01:23.392
For a slave like me?

01:23.680 --> 01:24.976
No…

01:26.032 --> 01:27.328
Time's up.

01:30.048 --> 01:31.920
Who are you?!

01:33.984 --> 01:35.632
I'm Alma.

01:35.762 --> 01:40.112
I'm the only one allowed to push Noel down.

03:14.352 --> 03:15.200
You're here.

03:17.024 --> 03:18.768
The potion's running out.

03:19.600 --> 03:20.592
Back then…

03:29.600 --> 03:32.736
Calling for help through Link
was the right choice.

03:33.728 --> 03:35.296
Do I just kill him?

03:37.008 --> 03:37.760
Do it.

03:37.902 --> 03:38.944
Okay.

03:41.216 --> 03:43.568
Don't do this. I don't want to kill a woman.

03:43.744 --> 03:46.613
That's hilarious! I'm stronger than you, you know.

03:46.700 --> 03:49.427
You've got that backwards!
You caught me off guard,

03:49.482 --> 03:51.683
and you still couldn't finish me off.

03:51.723 --> 03:52.411
Huh?

03:53.648 --> 03:56.544
I'm several levels above you!

03:58.324 --> 04:00.600
You're cheeky.

04:00.608 --> 04:02.736
Don't think I'll let you die easy.

04:03.552 --> 04:04.528
Accel.

04:04.928 --> 04:06.160
Quintuple!

04:06.474 --> 04:08.170
What is this speed?

04:08.288 --> 04:10.256
Is she kicking off the air to accelerate?!

04:13.152 --> 04:14.912
Crazy Cherry Blossoms!

04:19.728 --> 04:22.000
He can do that too…?!

04:22.800 --> 04:24.128
Calm and Serene.

04:27.888 --> 04:28.880
What was that?

04:29.472 --> 04:34.416
Calm and Serene. A skill that sharpens
his senses when he closes his eyes.

04:35.936 --> 04:39.120
It's no wonder blinding him didn't work.

04:42.352 --> 04:44.272
I thought I understood.

04:44.880 --> 04:46.576
There's always someone stronger.

04:47.440 --> 04:52.224
Especially as a Talker,
there are heights I can never reach.

04:54.096 --> 04:55.520
I see how it is.

04:55.872 --> 04:58.208
I had the right idea all along.

04:59.840 --> 05:01.251
I won't waver anymore.

05:01.376 --> 05:02.336
I won't mourn.

05:02.485 --> 05:04.735
I have only one path.

05:06.032 --> 05:08.128
I will conquer the strongest…

05:09.536 --> 05:11.136
…to become the strongest.

05:15.264 --> 05:17.712
I admit it. You're strong.

05:17.712 --> 05:20.944
So I'm going to make sure I kill you.

05:21.376 --> 05:23.120
Blood Poison.

05:23.120 --> 05:26.720
Then I won't think of you as a woman anymore.

05:27.664 --> 05:30.848
Iai Flash. My insta-kill technique.

05:31.930 --> 05:32.384
Now!

05:35.616 --> 05:37.584
That's enough! Retreat!

05:37.584 --> 05:40.832
- But the fight isn't…
- Silence! That's an order!

05:42.608 --> 05:43.696
You, leave too.

05:43.920 --> 05:45.904
I've summoned the military police.

05:46.407 --> 05:49.003
If you get arrested on
top of failing your mission,

05:49.004 --> 05:50.736
Albert will go mad with rage.

05:52.624 --> 05:55.920
I hate to do what you say, but you're right.

05:58.784 --> 06:01.456
Wait. I have a message for your boss.

06:06.032 --> 06:07.664
Surprise!

06:08.176 --> 06:09.840
So? Do you like it?

06:10.256 --> 06:12.208
A present from me!

06:13.360 --> 06:18.800
Don't worry. Miguel took
responsibility for your failure.

06:19.200 --> 06:20.864
Aren't I forgiving?

06:21.584 --> 06:22.880
But…

06:23.520 --> 06:28.304
No more chances. There's no one
left to cover for you.

06:29.312 --> 06:30.992
Next time. I swear.

06:31.152 --> 06:34.352
I knew you'd understand, my dutiful Koga.

06:34.736 --> 06:35.904
You can go.

06:36.304 --> 06:36.960
Yes, sir.

06:41.136 --> 06:43.264
I forgot one thing.

06:43.888 --> 06:45.936
Noel Stollen gave me a message for you.

06:46.352 --> 06:47.232
A message?

06:48.736 --> 06:51.552
"My motto is, make them pay
a thousand times over."

06:51.760 --> 06:55.840
"I'm going to crush
the Gambino family, personally."

06:56.192 --> 07:02.208
"If you don't like that, then quit being a chicken
and come kill me yourself."

07:07.616 --> 07:13.584
Did he really say that?
You aren't lying like the chief of Mintz Village?

07:14.080 --> 07:15.056
He did.

07:17.200 --> 07:20.208
I see. Interesting.

07:21.328 --> 07:22.992
I'll murder him!

07:22.992 --> 07:25.616
Laios, get the soldiers together!

07:25.616 --> 07:28.160
We're finding him and chopping him into pieces!

07:34.592 --> 07:36.704
You said too much.

07:37.376 --> 07:39.424
I'm sorry. I just…

07:40.224 --> 07:42.144
Were you mad that he killed Miguel?

07:42.576 --> 07:44.336
That's not it.

07:44.992 --> 07:48.032
He… wasn't a good master.

07:48.417 --> 07:49.393
Then what was it?

07:50.416 --> 07:54.608
He… Noel Stollen is amazing.

07:56.608 --> 07:58.576
He was… strong.

07:59.456 --> 08:04.064
Even as a Talker, the weakest Job,
he was a match for me.

08:04.992 --> 08:09.008
He must have worked himself
nearly to death to get to that point.

08:10.576 --> 08:16.656
But he can never defeat
a fighting-type Job like mine. There's a limit.

08:17.072 --> 08:17.968
So I'd guess.

08:18.064 --> 08:21.136
And yet, his eyes…

08:21.808 --> 08:23.264
They shone!

08:23.264 --> 08:26.320
They said, "I'm going to become
a man no one can defeat!"

08:26.704 --> 08:30.704
They gleamed with conviction in his victory!

08:30.944 --> 08:32.048
So…

08:32.582 --> 08:35.418
So you fell for him.

08:36.288 --> 08:39.696
No! I'm not into…

08:40.582 --> 08:42.928
I didn't mean it like that.

08:44.240 --> 08:48.288
When you admire an opponent's skill
and can't help but want to pursue them…

08:48.688 --> 08:52.400
That's what it means for a man
to fall for a fellow man.

08:53.920 --> 08:55.264
You'll get it soon enough.

08:58.576 --> 09:00.800
Has that happened to you, Laios?

09:04.064 --> 09:05.008
Yes.

09:06.352 --> 09:08.000
Long ago.

09:15.952 --> 09:18.368
So you're Noel Stollen.

09:18.864 --> 09:21.088
You look like a woman.

09:22.736 --> 09:25.136
One A-Rank. The rest are B.

09:25.936 --> 09:28.064
There are armed guards outside too.

09:31.840 --> 09:33.184
Disgusting!

09:33.184 --> 09:39.440
Seekers must really be broke
if you can only afford this cheap wine.

09:41.056 --> 09:44.912
Drinking someone else's drink
without being offered…

09:45.840 --> 09:48.960
You're quite the ill-mannered fellow, Albert.

09:49.472 --> 09:51.184
A dishonor on the Gambino name.

09:52.000 --> 09:56.640
Oh, sorry! You were only brought
into the family as an adult.

09:57.696 --> 10:01.984
I guess even the great boss before you
wasn't great at training his dogs.

10:02.528 --> 10:04.576
What'd you just say?!

10:04.863 --> 10:08.432
Get your dirty face away from me.
You'll spoil my appetite.

10:08.511 --> 10:10.112
You bastard!

10:10.528 --> 10:17.760
Should I rip up that cheeky mouth of yours
so you can never eat proper food again?

10:18.336 --> 10:25.120
I know that you can only bark like that
when your friends are around.

10:25.408 --> 10:28.032
You damn brat!

10:28.272 --> 10:30.176
Hey, Gambino boss.

10:31.952 --> 10:34.864
Violence is banned here.

10:35.296 --> 10:37.024
Who're you?

10:37.792 --> 10:41.200
I don't know what happened between you and Noel.

10:41.200 --> 10:44.384
But no starting fights here.

10:45.104 --> 10:47.872
This bar is meant for Seekers.

10:48.064 --> 10:51.104
I can't let outsiders do whatever they want here.

10:51.472 --> 10:54.912
We Seekers have honor too, you know.

10:55.136 --> 10:58.944
D-Do you know who I am?!

10:58.944 --> 11:00.624
I know.

11:00.800 --> 11:04.528
But that doesn't matter
when it comes to guarding our pride.

11:05.104 --> 11:08.304
You! Kill these fools! All of them!

11:09.808 --> 11:12.912
Boss, it would be easy to wipe all of them out.

11:13.184 --> 11:14.752
It'd only take a second.

11:15.248 --> 11:18.288
But how do you plan
to tell Papa Luciano about this?

11:18.608 --> 11:19.344
Huh?

11:21.168 --> 11:24.544
They already have an eye on you
because of the drugs.

11:24.544 --> 11:28.224
If you massacre Seekers publicly on top of that,

11:28.357 --> 11:30.224
the country won't be able to turn a blind eye.

11:30.768 --> 11:33.505
It'll be over for us.

11:33.623 --> 11:35.552
Well…

11:36.880 --> 11:40.256
If you insist anyway, then give the order again.

11:41.060 --> 11:46.128
Your orders are absolute.
We'll risk our lives to fight for you.

11:47.248 --> 11:48.320
But…

11:49.840 --> 11:52.416
You're hilarious, Albert Gambino!

11:52.768 --> 11:56.768
You bark so loud, but you can't stand up
to your Papa or the country.

11:57.072 --> 12:00.160
Deep down, you're a puny little plebe.

12:01.056 --> 12:04.288
You don't have the popularity
or the skill to lead an organization.

12:04.288 --> 12:06.400
Mad dog? Don't be stupid.

12:06.400 --> 12:09.824
Any stray dog would do better than you.

12:11.824 --> 12:13.920
Hey, don't get so angry.

12:14.313 --> 12:15.993
You'll make your blood pump faster.

12:16.696 --> 12:18.568
Since that wine you just drank…

12:19.472 --> 12:20.688
…was poisoned.

12:21.376 --> 12:23.552
P-P-Poisoned?!

12:24.048 --> 12:27.594
Yep. I added it right when you came in.

12:28.272 --> 12:30.592
That was why it tasted bad.

12:31.456 --> 12:34.208
You couldn't have…

12:35.040 --> 12:36.672
But…

12:37.984 --> 12:40.816
How did you know I'd drink it?!

12:40.816 --> 12:42.112
You had no…

12:42.400 --> 12:44.176
No proof, of course.

12:44.176 --> 12:48.096
But I stood to gain if you drank it
and to lose nothing if you didn't.

12:49.248 --> 12:50.880
Not a bad gamble, I'd say.

12:55.017 --> 12:56.633
Vomiting won't save you.

12:56.766 --> 12:59.408
It's already absorbed out of your stomach.

13:00.080 --> 13:02.416
You're going to die.

13:04.112 --> 13:05.376
D-Doctor!

13:05.376 --> 13:08.480
Someone get me a doctor!

13:16.032 --> 13:18.784
You're some Talker, Noel Stollen.

13:19.424 --> 13:20.592
What are you talking about?

13:25.456 --> 13:26.432
Good wine.

13:26.832 --> 13:28.608
The poison's a bluff, right?

13:31.442 --> 13:33.666
You've got gutsy eyes.

13:34.288 --> 13:35.920
Koga was right about you.

13:37.936 --> 13:39.168
This is for the wine.

13:39.584 --> 13:41.392
I'll overlook what happened today.

13:41.712 --> 13:43.392
Get out of the capital immediately.

13:44.464 --> 13:45.808
What if I said no?

13:46.800 --> 13:48.752
I'd kill you. Right here.

13:51.792 --> 13:52.720
All right.

13:54.257 --> 13:55.857
We'll leave the capital.

13:56.672 --> 13:58.240
Let's call it even.

13:58.528 --> 13:59.632
Smart boy.

14:03.824 --> 14:05.200
Are you really leaving?

14:05.872 --> 14:10.656
Yep. My Seeker career is over. Oh, well.

14:10.946 --> 14:13.938
Tch, you formidable bastard.

14:21.456 --> 14:25.645
Wow! Everything went exactly
how you said it would!

14:25.731 --> 14:27.376
It's too early to celebrate.

14:27.376 --> 14:29.024
Our real challenge starts now.

14:29.392 --> 14:32.160
We're coming back after a week, right?

14:32.293 --> 14:33.472
That's the plan.

14:34.912 --> 14:37.036
There's something I want to look into.

14:37.161 --> 14:38.912
I'll hide out in the mountains.

14:39.328 --> 14:42.512
I'm going to kill that swordsman next time.

14:43.712 --> 14:44.800
Gotcha.

14:46.992 --> 14:48.816
See you in a week, then.

14:49.584 --> 14:51.680
Yeah. In a week.

14:53.696 --> 14:55.504
Gambino family…

14:57.968 --> 14:59.984
I'll swallow you whole.

15:00.920 --> 15:03.888
[VII - Virtueless World]

15:06.162 --> 15:10.114
You're back after just one week.

15:13.568 --> 15:18.016
You idiot! All you had to do
was stay out of the capital!

15:18.592 --> 15:20.512
Such raucous laughter.

15:21.136 --> 15:23.488
It really shows your bad breeding.

15:23.776 --> 15:29.376
Even your backtalk is music to my ears now.

15:29.920 --> 15:33.888
Break his limbs so he can't move.
Don't kill him right away.

15:35.712 --> 15:37.120
The night is young.

15:37.728 --> 15:40.592
Let's take our time and enjoy this.

15:43.824 --> 15:46.064
Hey! Didn't you hear me?

15:46.064 --> 15:47.264
Do it now…

15:51.488 --> 15:52.816
What is it?

15:53.360 --> 15:55.088
Why isn't anyone listening to me?!

15:55.088 --> 15:56.896
Explain, Laios!

15:59.211 --> 16:01.248
W-What's the meaning of this?

16:01.408 --> 16:03.056
What's going on…?

16:04.256 --> 16:07.392
This has been a great clown act, Albert Gambino.

16:07.600 --> 16:10.016
It's no wonder your grunts aren't listening.

16:10.192 --> 16:12.992
You lost your qualification to be leader.

16:15.088 --> 16:17.872
Through your own foolish acts.

16:20.528 --> 16:24.144
Brother! We can't take it anymore!

16:24.848 --> 16:29.024
How long do we have to keep
obeying this crazy boss?!

16:32.160 --> 16:35.952
The girl we took care of today had this on her.

16:36.496 --> 16:38.224
She treasured it.

16:39.696 --> 16:42.944
She was just a kid, and we did
such awful things to her.

16:44.112 --> 16:46.672
No flesh-and-blood human would ever order that!

16:46.672 --> 16:48.528
I feel the same!

16:48.528 --> 16:52.650
We entered this world because
we aspired to the former boss's chivalry!

16:52.650 --> 16:54.720
Not to beat down the defenseless!

16:54.720 --> 16:56.720
Can't you do something?!

16:56.944 --> 16:58.256
Brother!

16:59.120 --> 17:00.432
My, my.

17:00.912 --> 17:02.768
You mustn't fight among yourselves.

17:11.864 --> 17:14.358
Weren't you supposed to leave the capital?

17:14.848 --> 17:18.000
I did, just like I promised. For a week.

17:18.624 --> 17:20.576
It was a nice vacation.

17:21.424 --> 17:24.704
You know what you're doing right now, right?

17:25.568 --> 17:29.376
Yeah. But I'm not here to stir up trouble.

17:29.712 --> 17:34.128
I'm just bringing you a souvenir from my vacation.

17:35.648 --> 17:36.304
Is this…?!

17:37.632 --> 17:41.552
Here's what you asked for.
Albert's birth certificate.

17:42.506 --> 17:46.202
Albert's mother was married to another man.

17:47.200 --> 17:50.224
He's lying about being
the former boss's illegitimate child.

17:51.193 --> 17:55.625
It's true that his mother
had an affair with the former boss.

17:55.904 --> 17:58.016
But it was before she was married.

17:58.752 --> 18:05.200
It's as good as impossible that
he fathered Albert based on this birth date.

18:05.200 --> 18:06.880
Did the former boss know?

18:07.456 --> 18:09.600
Most likely, yes.

18:10.144 --> 18:15.744
But his past lover was depending
on him for help, and he obliged.

18:18.640 --> 18:23.552
He knew the woman was lying about Albert
being his child, but he accepted everything.

18:24.672 --> 18:26.480
As a vestige of a former love.

18:28.192 --> 18:29.968
That's the truth of the situation.

18:30.592 --> 18:31.696
I see.

18:32.096 --> 18:36.400
Is that all? This investigation was pretty tough.

18:36.736 --> 18:38.864
And that means you've paid your debts, right?

18:41.696 --> 18:44.448
I have one more request for you.

18:45.482 --> 18:46.794
What should I look into?

18:47.416 --> 18:49.496
The former boss's cause of death.

18:50.048 --> 18:52.384
I want you to find the doctor
who was at his deathbed.

18:53.360 --> 18:54.288
Do you mean…

18:55.264 --> 18:59.840
The one greatest crime Albert ever committed.

19:00.960 --> 19:02.576
This'll have him cornered.

19:05.296 --> 19:08.080
I have two questions for you, boss.

19:08.784 --> 19:10.240
What…?

19:10.832 --> 19:14.288
Firstly, you aren't really
our former boss's son, are you?

19:14.560 --> 19:18.368
Huh?! What are you… Where did you…?!

19:18.704 --> 19:23.616
Secondly, you poisoned the former boss
and made it look like an illness.

19:24.592 --> 19:26.880
Th… That's idiotic!

19:28.368 --> 19:30.160
What proof do you have?!

19:30.160 --> 19:33.808
Did you dig up his grave
to do an autopsy or something?!

19:34.080 --> 19:35.760
There's no need.

19:37.120 --> 19:41.376
The doctor who was at his deathbed
told me everything.

19:42.320 --> 19:47.664
How the boss had suspicious symptoms,
but you paid him to shut up.

19:48.608 --> 19:51.680
That scene at the bar was a blunder.

19:51.968 --> 19:55.664
You went into such a panic
when you heard you'd been poisoned.

19:56.400 --> 20:00.832
It's basically a confession that
you're personally familiar with what it does.

20:01.376 --> 20:03.552
Bullshit! You're lying!

20:03.552 --> 20:04.496
Confess.

20:06.496 --> 20:09.888
We Talkers have a convenient skill, you see.

20:10.288 --> 20:14.226
We can force people to confess their crimes.

20:14.398 --> 20:16.430
I used it on the doctor.

20:17.312 --> 20:18.832
The night is young.

20:19.201 --> 20:22.129
Let's take our time and enjoy this.

20:29.040 --> 20:33.184
Albert, we can't follow your orders anymore.

20:34.720 --> 20:36.608
Y-You bastards…

20:37.920 --> 20:42.384
We can't keep propping someone up
who we neither respect nor have any obligation to.

20:43.120 --> 20:46.944
That's nonsense! It was the former boss
who passed the position on to me!

20:47.264 --> 20:49.712
After you killed him!

20:53.392 --> 20:55.584
You're an irredeemable man.

20:55.856 --> 20:57.824
But there's the former boss's will to consider.

20:59.040 --> 21:00.880
I'll give you one last chance.

21:04.384 --> 21:06.096
A one-on-one duel.

21:06.640 --> 21:10.144
If you win, I'll officially
recognize you as our boss.

21:10.688 --> 21:12.768
A-A duel…?!

21:13.120 --> 21:17.664
Don't be stupid! Are you telling me
to fight one of them?!

21:17.664 --> 21:20.192
You don't have to fight.

21:20.832 --> 21:23.232
I'll allow you to pick a stand-in.

21:24.768 --> 21:26.704
You can choose any one of us.

21:27.760 --> 21:29.888
Why would I do that?!

21:29.888 --> 21:32.112
I'm Albert Gambino!

21:32.112 --> 21:35.504
I have no need to listen to anything you say!

21:35.984 --> 21:40.112
Pathetic. Shut up and get ready to fight.

21:40.720 --> 21:44.096
I'm embarrassed as a fellow boss.

21:44.560 --> 21:47.168
Finocchio Barzini?!

21:47.776 --> 21:49.712
Where are your manners?

21:49.712 --> 21:53.488
That's Miss Finocchio to you.

21:54.000 --> 21:55.824
Why are you…

21:55.824 --> 21:57.120
Why?

21:59.568 --> 22:03.680
To serve as a witness to the duel, of course.

23:35.000 --> 23:40.039
[VIII - The King's Vessel]
